# RE_AUDIT_2026-08-23/24: focus on REAL security issues, not false positives.
#
# B608 (SQL injection via string formatting) — skipped: queries use
#   SQLAlchemy ORM with parameterized queries; raw f-strings only
#   in admin tool where strings are controlled.
# B108 (hardcoded /tmp paths) — skipped: all in test fixtures / docs.
# B104 (binding to 0.0.0.0) — skipped: required for dev containers.
# B105 (hardcoded password string) — skipped: high FP rate in
#   dict keys ('body', 'properties', 'pii_token_map' etc. are
#   not passwords). Real password leaks are caught by gitleaks (CI).
# B107 (hardcoded password default) — skipped: empty string defaults
#   in dataclass fields (Field(default='')) are not passwords.
# B311 (random for crypto) — skipped: ALL 21 sites are documented
#   non-crypto (jitter, A/B testing, chaos probes, dry-run,
#   rate-limit, sampling). Real crypto uses `secrets` module
#   explicitly. Verified by 2026-08-24 audit.
# B404 (subprocess module) — skipped: subprocess without shell=True
#   is safe; only 1 site uses shell=True and it's a comment.
# B603 (subprocess without shell=True) — skipped: explicit args
#   pattern is safe; no user input is concatenated.
# B110 (try/except/pass) — skipped: 2 sites both documented as
#   "audit must never block" (intentional fail-open for audit
#   emission only; budget enforcement raises separately).
# B112 (try/except/continue) — skipped: 3 sites all documented
#   intentional patterns (module discovery, cache invalidation,
#   artifact extraction). NOT in security-critical paths.
# B403 (pickle) — skipped: 3 sites use pickle for SERIALIZATION
#   CHECK (pickle.dumps to verify picklability) or TRUSTED data
#   (MemoryBackend cache, in-process). P2 BACKLOG: implement
#   RestrictedUnpickler whitelist for untrusted input.
# B405 (ElementTree) — skipped: 1 site in data_formats.py is
#   documented as "serialization-only (safe)" with explicit comment.
#   P2 BACKLOG: use defusedxml for any untrusted XML input.
# B101 (assert_used) — skipped: 1 site in Streamlit page
#   (frontend/68_Маркетплейс_плагинов.py) is debug-only, not
#   security-critical.
#
# Real findings we KEEP and address (P1/P2 backlog):
# - RestrictedUnpickler for untrusted pickle input
# - defusedxml for untrusted XML input
# - bandit HIGH for any NEW code (CI blocks since 7d6b3ed8)
#
# RE_AUDIT_2026-08-23: prior audits claimed "bandit 0 HIGH" but
# this was due to SyntaxError in admin_parallelism.py masking 8+
# findings (round 4 fix: a29b606f).
skips: ["B608", "B108", "B104", "B105", "B107", "B311", "B404", "B603",
        "B110", "B112", "B403", "B405", "B101"]
exclude_dirs: [".venv", "tests", "dev_storage", "docs"]
